{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/443372-songs-that-remind-you-of-wod","id":443372,"title":"Songs that remind you of WoD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-15T17:22:15-07:00","id":443372,"title":"Songs that remind you of WoD","content":"I like making fanmixes for various games- songs that capture the feeling of the setting. I have fanmixes for a number of the individual WoD games, but I've also made one for the setting as a whole-<br /> <br /> Scary Monsters- David Bowie<br /> Midnight City- M83<br /> Mad World- Gary Jules<br /> Ain't No Rest for the Wicked- Cage the Elephant<br /> Fly- Michael Guy Bowman<br /> Hurt- Johnny Cash<br /> Superstition- Stevie Wonder<br /> Scab and Plaster- Marina and the Diamonds<br /> Sono chi no Sadame- Tommy<br /> Twister- Takeharu Ishimoto<br /> Neon Valley Street- Janelle Monae<br /> Everybody Wants to Rule the World- Tears for Fears<br /> Occasional Demons- Jethro Tull<br /> Eleanor Rigby- The Beatles<br /> The World- Jack White<br /> Break Out- The Protomen<br /> Boulevard of Broken Dreams- Masters of Chant (cover)<br /> These Streets- Bastille<br /> Head On- Man Man<br /> Tubular Bells- Mike Oldfield<br /> Thriller- Michael Jackson<br /> Monster Mash- Bobby Pickett<br /> Good for Your Soul- Oingo Boingo<br /> Let's Begin- Blue Man Group<br /> Twilight Galaxy- Metric","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T19:31:52-07:00","id":443588,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#006699\"><b>Dance with the Devil - Immortal Technique</b></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And now the devil follows me wherever I go<br /> In fact, I'm sure he's standing among one of you at my shows<br /> And every street cipher listening to little thugs flow<br /> He could be standing right next to you and you wouldn't know<br /> The devil grows inside the hearts of the selfish and wicked<br /> White, brown, yellow and black, color is not restricted<br /> You have a self-destructive destiny when you're inflicted<br /> And you'll be one of God's children who fell from the top<br /> There's no diversity because we're burning in the melting pot. </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#0099cc\"><b>\u82b1 - Asa-Chang &amp; \u5de1\u793c</b></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Nobody has ever seen it before<br /> and nobody is ever supposed to see it<br /> and it's never supposed to bloom<br /> but still this flower has bloomed<br /> right here, this flower right here,<br /> after all, right here, it has bloomed. </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#00ccff\"><b>San Bernadino - The Mountain Goats</b></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And flaming swords may guard the Garden of Eden<br /> But we consulted maps from earlier days<br /> Dead languages on our tongues<br /> Holding on to our last hope<br /> And the day was bright and fine<br /> And the highway sign said, &quot;San Bernadino welcomes you.&quot; </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#999933\"><b>Ogdru Jahad - The Darkest of the Hillside Thickets</b></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> They whispered of a prison<br /> Ragnarok engine humming<br /> Wrapped they in darkness dreaming<br /> They are the mighty children<br /> Behold the doomsday project<br /> Frog legions bear their vessel<br /> Seven in Earth and Heaven. </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#336600\"><b>Miner at the Dial-a-View - Grandaddy</b></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I found your house and I saw your car<br /> But I've no idea where you are<br /> From the Dial-a-View<br /> <br /> Tire scraps on the federal roads<br /> Look like crash-landed crows<br /> From the Dial-a-View. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T09:06:09-07:00","id":444341,"title":"","content":"Based on Gameline, Songs that i Think fit in WoD.<br /> <br /> <b>Mortals/Hunter:</b><br /> Foo Fighters- The Pretender.<br /> <i>&quot;What if i said that i Never Surrender&quot; Mortal Heroes and Hunters Summing up the Vigil....</i><br /> Breaking Benjamin- Unknown Soldier<br /> <i>Makes me think of a Broken Mortal/Hunter who's seen abit too much too go back into ignorance.</i><br /> Skillet- Lucy<br /> <i>&quot;Hey Lucy i remembered your Birthday&quot; Reminiscing on lives lost too the Vigil.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Vampire:</b><br /> Skillet- Awake and Alive<br /> <i>&quot;I'm at war with the world, and they wanna pull me into the Dark&quot; Vampire at Odds with his own Nature.</i><br /> Linkin Park- Until it's Gone<br /> <i>&quot;I thought I kept you safe and sound, I thought I made you strong, But something made me realize,That I was wrong&quot; Vampire Losing a Touchstone Mortal.</i><br /> Two Steps from Hell- He who Brings the Night<br /> <i>It's... A Cop out Based on the Title... but i Can See a Nosferatu stalking the Shadows Chasing a Victim with it going in the Background... Until.... &quot;Boo&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Promethean:</b><br /> Linkin Park- Until it's Gone<br /> <i>&quot;A fire needs a space to burn, A breath to build a glow, I've heard it said a thousand times, But now I know&quot; The Pilgrimage... In 4 Lines.</i><br /> Smash Mouth- Why Can't we be Friends<br /> <i>&quot;Why Can't we be Friends, Why can't we be Friends&quot; A Created Desperately Trying too understand Why people Hate Him/Her.</i><br /> Skillet- Monster<br /> <i>Just... the Whole Song. (Pretty Much could apply too All the Splats... But A Promethean going Centani/Stannum Works... Just.. So Well)</i><br /> <br /> <b>Changeling:</b><br /> Two Steps from Hell- The End is the Beginning<br /> <i>*IC* Stepping Out of your Masters Realm into the Hedge was Hard... the Guards wouldn't Leave you, the Hounds kept Chasing and your Appearance made you stand out, Eventually you Found yourself out of the Living Hell and into another one, The Spines of the Hedge Tearing away Pieces of yourself, Memories, Skin, Flesh, Soul... You can Hear the Whispers the Hounds.. they are Coming... But.. You Won't go Back. Never.</i><br /> Skillet- Would it Matter<br /> <i>&quot;If i Wasn't here Tomorrow would anybody Care&quot; A Changeling Finding himself Replaced by a Fetch.... And Having a bout of Depression.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> ... That's All of them for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":3981,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","user":"RickmanUK","date":". 03-17-2015, 01:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T14:48:17-07:00","id":444926,"title":"","content":"<b>Mortals:</b><br /> Genesis - Land of Confusion (as covered by Disturbed)<br /> <i>&quot;This is the world we live in, And these are the hands we're given, Use them and let's start trying, To make it a place worth living in&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Vampire:</b><br /> Avenged Sevenfold - Bat Country<br /> <i>&quot;Sometimes I don't know why we'd rather live than die, We look up towards the sky for answers to our lives, We may get some solutions but most just pass us by, Don't want your absolution cause I can't make it right, I'll make a beast out of myself, Gets rid of all the pain of being a man&quot;</i> - Vampire losing himself to The Beast<br /> <br /> Brand New - Me Vs. Maradonna Vs. Elvis<br /> <i>&quot;Brass buttons on your coat hold the cold, In the shape of a heart that they cut out of stone, You're using all your looks that you've thrown from the start, If you let me have my way I swear I'll tear you apart, 'cause it's all you can be, You're a drunk and you're scared, It's ladies' night, all the girls drink for free&quot;</i> - The whole song sounds like a Daeva hunting<br /> <br /> <b>Werewolf:</b><br /> Bullet For My Valentine - Waking the Demon<br /> <i>&quot;Caution!, There's just no limit to the boundaries you push!, I've warned you but still you just fuck with my mind!, There's no escape from this rage that I feel!, Nothing is real!&quot;</i> - Kuruth<br /> <br /> Florence + The Machine - Howl<br /> <i>&quot;Now there's no holding back, I'm making to attack, My blood is singing with your voice, I want to pour it out, The saints can't help me now, the ropes have been unbound, I hunt for you with bloody feet across the hallow'd ground, like some child possessed, the beast howls in my veins&quot;</i> - A slightly more introspective look at being a Werewolf. Also does a great job capturing the Forsaken's <i>need</i> for Siskur-dah<br /> <br /> <b>Mage:</b><br /> Muse - Uprising<br /> <i>&quot;Another promise, another seed, Another packaged lie to keep us trapped in greed, And all the green belts wrapped around our minds, And endless red tape to keep the truth confined, Interchanging mind control, Come, let the revolution take its toll, If you could flick the switch and open your third eye, You'd see that we should never be afraid to die&quot;</i> - Captures The Lie and Mage's struggle against it very well. &quot;They&quot; in this song could easily be the Exarchs.<br /> <br /> <b>Promethean:</b><br /> Radiohead - Creep<br /> <i>&quot;I don't care if it hurts, I wanna have control, I want a perfect body, I want a perfect soul ... You're so fucking special, I wish I was special&quot;</i> - Sums up how Prometheans feel about humanity<br /> <br /> <b>Changeling:</b><br /> My Chemical Romance - It's Not A Fashion Statement, It's A Death Wish<br /> <i>&quot;Do you remember that day when we met, you told me this gets harder, well it did, been holding on forever, promise me that when I'm gone you'll kill my enemies, the damage you've inflicted,, temporary wounds, I'm coming back from the dead and I'll take you home with me, I'm taking back the life you stole&quot;</i> - This song captures the way Changelings feel about their fetches pretty damn well<br /> <br /> Muse - Madness<br /> <i>&quot;I, I can't get these memories out of my mind, And some kind of madness has started to evolve. And I, I tried so hard to let you go, But some kind of madness is swallowing me whole, yeah&quot;</i> - A Changeling losing Clarity<br /> <br /> <b>Hunter:</b><br /> Enter Shikari - Sssnakepit<br /> <i>&quot;We're just a group of your white blood cells, Fighting off parasites, We're your system mechanics, Trying to fix this machine ... Come and join the party, leave anxieties behind, When the weight of all the world is pushing down, Just push right back!&quot;</i> - Sounds a lot like The Vigil<br /> <br /> <b>Geist:</b><br /> Evanescence - Bring Me To Life<br /> <i>&quot;Wake me up inside, Wake me up inside, Call my name and save me from the dark, Bid my blood to run, Before I come undone, Save me from the nothing I've become, Now that I know what I'm without, You can't just leave me, Breathe into me and make me real, Bring me to life&quot;</i> - A Sin-Eater making The Bargain with a Geist<br /> <br /> <b>Mummy:</b><br /> Linkin Park - Breaking the Habit<br /> <i>&quot;Memories consume, Like opening the wound, I'm picking me apart again ... I don't know what's worth fighting for, Or why I have to scream, But now I have some clarity, To show you what I mean, I don't know how I got this way, I'll never be alright&quot;</i> - A Mummy beginning to question their past and the Shan'iatu","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","name":"Aurumae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T04:50:56-07:00","id":445589,"title":"","content":"Anything by the group Zombie Girl. They're an industrial band that broke up a handful of years ago, but their music has the creep factor of the World of Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T09:38:22-07:00","id":446054,"title":"","content":"Ecliptica (Album) - Sonata Arctica<br /> Basically every single song on the album can be mapped to one of the splats. Most notable are:<br /> Full Moon: literally a song about a Werewolf<br /> <i>&quot;She sees the change in him but can't / Run away run away run away / Full moon is on the sky and he's not a man anymore&quot;</i><br /> Replica: Changeling<br /> <i>&quot;Nothing's what it seems to be / I'm a replica, a replica / Empty shell inside of me / I'm not myself, I'm a replica of me&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Demon Eyes - The Answer<br /> Hunter<br /> <i>&quot;Lookin' out my narrow window, tell you what I see / The pitbulls that run the streets are closing in on me / Could it be this paranoia keeping me intact? / Lock the door and load my gun, this time I'm fighting back&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Prayer of the Refugee/Drones - Rise Against<br /> Demon<br /> <i>&quot;We are the angry and the desperate, the hungry and the cold / We are the ones who kept quiet, and always did what we were told / But we've been sweating while you slept so calm in the safety of your home / We've been pulling out the nails that hold up everything you've known&quot;</i><br /> <i>&quot;...Yell confessions from the greatest heights where no one can hear / All my fears my insecurities are falling like tears <br /> If you see me please just walk on by, walk on by / Forget my name and I'll forget it too / Failed attempts at living simple lives, simple lives / Are what keep me coming back to you</i><br /> <i>The drones all slave away / They're working overtime / They serve a faceless queen / They never question why / Disciples of a god / That neither lives nor breathes / But we have bills to pay / Yeah we have mouths to feed (I. Won't. Go. Back.)&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Rickman already mentioned The Pretender, though I see it more in the light of Hellspawn from Demon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T10:53:56-07:00","id":446176,"title":"","content":"One that i see as more For Villians in a Campaign.... <b>The Hounds- Protomen</b><br /> <i>&quot;When I say he was a monster, when I set fire to his name, It does not matter where you hear it from, whether truth or lies, It gets said all the same.&quot;</i><br /> Pretty much See A Prince Calling a Bloodhunt, A Mob Leader Organizing a Hunt for Prometheans (&quot;Them That Caused all the Towns Issues&quot;), Hell Pretty much Anyone... Against anyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":3981,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","user":"RickmanUK","date":".  Edit for Appearance. 03-17-2015, 01:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T22:26:24-07:00","id":447154,"title":"","content":"Disturbed - Devour for <i>Vampire: the Requiem</i> <div align=\"center\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>I will devour you<br /> Take all the pain away<br /> I cannot stay my hand<br /> From reaching out so that I can<br /> Empower you<br /> For all eternity<br /> It seems to ease my mind<br /> To know that you've brought<br /> Meaning to my life</i> </div> </div> </div></div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This song always reminds me of Diablerie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u><b>My Homebrew</b></u><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PLu_eTg03h4ogiTSGSkzEB7T_1YpB9_VkhHmgZN41-I/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Star Wars d10</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">T</a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">he Fallen for Demon: the Descent</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-TDr4NF_5cUn-In2vjI9P5LTKqsu9B4-OMxbnbaTgT8/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Requiem for a Masquerade: VtR 2e Cainite Conversion</a> (<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpKi5giBNsQrZRLIRRjaCe7sHVm1Q13ravVYlE45Dbw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Vampira Roma</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1601-dreaminggod","name":"Dreaminggod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"745"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T03:36:43-07:00","id":458785,"title":"","content":"Another One for 